| M06 - Dashboard & View | schedule, notification, audit_history | High |
| M07 - Auto-scheduling | schedule, algorithm_config, algorithm_metrics | High |

## Architecture Guidelines

1. **Reusable constraint checking**: Create shared service for ALL conflict detection logic
2. **Audit logging**: Log all CREATE/UPDATE/DELETE operations to audit_history
3. **Compensation auto-calculate**: Calculate and lock compensation days when scheduling L01
4. **Period workflow**: Always validate DRAFT → PUBLISHED → ARCHIVED flow

